{"seq":1,"slug":"inventing-the-gpu","title":"发明GPU","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-graphics-revolution","title":"图形处理的革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu/the-graphics-revolution","wordCount":2246,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"redefining-the-gpu","title":"重新定义 GPU","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu/redefining-the-gpu","wordCount":2357,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 发明GPU\n\n本章呈现黄仁勋与英伟达在GPU上的开创性贡献。英伟达不仅引领了图形处理的革命，更将GPU，从图形处理的部件，重新定义为强大的通用并行计算引擎，为人工智能革命埋下了伏笔。两篇文档，分别呈现图形处理的革命，以及重新定义GPU的远见。\n"}